<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:center"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">4.</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top">Approval of the Amended 2018 Plan</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top">Under current Nasdaq Rules, majority of the votes cast in person or by proxy; shares voted &#8220;For&#8221; the proposal must exceed the number of shares voted &#8220;Against&#8221; the proposal.</td>
