<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Consists of (a) 183,298 shares of common stock, (b) 105,709 shares of common stock issuable upon the exercise of options within 60 days of April&#160;8, 2026 and (c) 37,621 shares of common stock issuable upon the exercise of warrants within 60 days of April&#160;8, 2026. </p></td></tr></table>
